license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code and evaluation artifacts accompanying the manuscript
  "Regime-Adaptive Conformal Guardrails for Prompt Injection Attacks under
  Distribution Shift". This release includes the three-stage guardrail
  implementation, drift-triggered and regime-adaptive conformal recalibration,
  synthetic evaluation datasets, public-benchmark retrieval scripts and
  provenance manifest, recorded experimental results, cached model scores,
  figure-generation scripts, unit tests, and the pinned Python dependency list.
keywords:
  - prompt injection
  - conformal prediction
  - distribution shift
  - AI security
  - reproducibility
